step Fly to Orgrimmar
  only !Druid
  zone Desolace
  goto 21.6,74.0 "Shadowprey Village flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Thunder Bluff
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  tip Fly from Shadowprey Village to Thunder Bluff and train with Turak Runetotem on Elder Rise; fly on to Orgrimmar from there.
  fly "Thunder Bluff"
  train class

step Back to Orgrimmar
  only Druid
  zone Thunder Bluff
  goto 46.7,49.9 "Thunder Bluff flight master"
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  zone Orgrimmar

step Keldran
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Keldran stands in the Valley of Spirits on the west side of the city.
  turnin 1436                         -- Keldran

step Orgrimmar trainers
  only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Train while you are in the city.
  train class

step Fly to Ratchet
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Booty Bay first: the goblins' boat sails there from Ratchet, and every Booty Bay quest is for the north of the vale, which you then walk up into.
  goto 45.3,63.7 "Orgrimmar flight master"
  fly "Ratchet"
  zone The Barrens

step Ratchet
  zone The Barrens
  tip Gazlowe waits upstairs in the house by the flight master; Wharfmaster Dizzywig stands on the docks, beside the boat.
  turnin 1178                         -- Gazlowe, upstairs
  accept 1180                         -- Gazlowe: for Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay, where the boat goes
  turnin 1111                         -- Wharfmaster Dizzywig, on the docks
  note Dizzywig's parts go back to Kravel in the Shimmering Flats, off the route: leave them.

step Boat to Booty Bay
  zone The Barrens
  goto 63.4,38.5 "Boat to Booty Bay"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Booty Bay

