# Stranglethorn's northern half at 34-36, between Desolace and Dustwallow (the 2026-11-07
# re-order; before it, it came straight after Desolace and Hillsbrad).
#
# Flow: Shadowprey Village (where the previous guide ends) -> fly to Orgrimmar (Alliance
# Relations, training) -> fly to Ratchet (Gazlowe, Dizzywig) -> boat to Booty Bay (flight
# path, the vale's quests) -> the road north to Grom'gol (flight path) -> Nesingwary's camp,
# the river (Krazek's investigation) -> young tigers and panthers and the Bloodscalp trolls ->
# Nesingwary -> tigers, panthers and the Venture Co. geologists ->
# Nesingwary -> elder tigers -> Nesingwary -> the basilisks, raptors, Bloodscalp village and Zimmix
# at Zul'Kunda -> Nesingwary -> Lashtail raptors -> Grom'gol -> fly to Booty Bay -> fly to Grom'gol
# (top-up to 35 if needed) -> the Vile Reef and the Bloodscalp ruins -> Grom'gol -> Shadowmaw, the tigresses and the Snapjaw river ->
# the Mosh'Ogg camp -> Grom'gol, where the next guide takes the zeppelin to Orgrimmar.
# Before 0.3.6's last pass the guide came in by zeppelin and walked from Nesingwary's camp all
# the way down the vale to Booty Bay for its quests and flight path (2,900 yd), then flew back.
#
# Optional extras:
# - Crystal in the Mountains (635) starts from the Pendant of Myzrael, a 0.01-0.08% drop from
#   the trolls; take it only if one drops (it ends in Arathi).
# - The Green Hills of Stranglethorn (338-342): its pages drop at about 1% each from the
#   vale's trolls (or buy them). Keep every page: the chapters are accepted and turned in together
#   at Nesingwary's camp on the next Stranglethorn visit (forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale),
#   so they don't take five quest log slots from 35 to 40.
#
# Some Assembly Required (577) is accepted and its skins gathered here, and handed in on the
# Booty Bay stop of forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale.
#
# Class training: in Orgrimmar at the start (Druids in Thunder Bluff on the flight from
# Shadowprey; Paladins train next with Garen Largo in the Undercity, at about 38). The Warlock
# Felhunter's Damaged Chest stop (1803) is in forever/class/warlock/felhunter-horde.
#
# Carried on: Trollbane (638) for Arathi (forever/horde/30-40/05-arathi-highlands).
#
# Not taken: Marg Speaks (1261): Marg's note is offered only after The Troll Witchdoctor
# (1240), which is turned in at Grom'gol in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale.
# Goblin Sponsorship part 4 (1182, 2,850 XP): Foreman Cozzle (38) keeps the key inside the Venture Co. house
# on Lake Nazferiti, with Venture Co. Agents (39) in and around it, four and five levels over players here
# (level model 33.6; recorded players killed him at a 25th percentile of 35.7). No later Horde stop passes the
# house (40-50/01's Venture Co. mine is the southern one), so the errand is left out of the solo route.
# Anything of Value, Where's the Key? and Zimmix's Great Escape (97328, 97329, 97331) are done on the walk
# west from Nesingwary's camp, among the Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics (34-35) of Zul'Kunda, and
# handed in to Wharfmaster Lozgil on the Booty Bay stop, before the top-up to 35.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Nesingwary's camp

step Nesingwary's camp
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Follow the road north out of Grom'gol; Nesingwary's hunting camp sits on the hill north-east of the river. Krazek wants it investigated: walk among its tents. From here on, keep every page of The Green Hills of Stranglethorn you loot: Barnil takes them on your next Stranglethorn visit.
  accept 583                          -- Barnil Stonepot
  turnin 583                          -- Hemet Nesingwary
  turnin 5762
  turnin 5763
  accept 194
  accept 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  complete 201 @35.65,10.59

step Nesingwary's Expedition: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip River Crocolisks lie along the river below the camp. Young Stranglethorn Tigers prowl west of the camp, Young Panthers east of it. Head west past the camp. Stranglethorn Raptors (33-34) hunt the clearings, and the Bloodscalp trolls hold the ruins on the coast: every Bloodscalp can drop a tusk. A Pendant of Myzrael is a very rare drop from them: if one drops, read it. Careful: The troll camps have many patrolling mobs, so other trolls often join a fight.
  collect 4053 quest 575
  kill 681 quest 185
  kill 683 quest 190
  collect 3901 quest 581
  collect 4614 x1 optional
  accept 635 optional

step Nesingwary's camp
  turnin 185                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 186
  turnin 190                          -- Sir S. J. Erlgadin
  accept 191

step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Stranglethorn Tigers (32) roam the hills around the camp and south of it, Panthers (32) the clearings west and south-west of it. The Venture Co. Geologists (34-36), who carry the Tumbled Crystals, work the camps by Lake Nazferiti, south-east of the camp. Careful: Venture Co. Agents (39) stand among the geologists in the western camps by the Venture Co. house: work the eastern camps, away from them.
  kill 682 quest 186
  collect 4106 quest 213 @46.3,21.4 map 1434 -- Tumbled Crystals, from the geologists of the eastern camps
  kill 736 quest 191

