  turnin 186                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 187

step Elder Stranglethorn Tigers
  tip The Elder Stranglethorn Tigers (34-35) roam the hills south-west of the camp. Careful: Troll camps are close to the tiger area, and trolls can join a fight if you pull carelessly.
  kill 1085 quest 187

step Nesingwary's camp
  tip Back north to the camp.
  turnin 187                          -- Ajeck Rouack
  accept 188                          -- Ajeck Rouack: Sin'Dall (37) waits for your next Nesingwary stop, at about 40 in forever/horde/40-50/01-stranglethorn-vale

step Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip On the walk west from Nesingwary's camp, a pile of Thoroughly Scavenged Supplies lies by the path: it starts Anything of Value, whose Stolen Shipments lie in the Ruins of Zul'Kunda on the coast ahead.
  accept 97328 object 661516 @31.5,12.85 map 1434

step The Savage Coast: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip West past the camp, Crystal Spine Basilisks (34-35) sit on the rocks; every Bloodscalp in the village beyond can drop an ear.
  tip Leave Sin'Dall, the level 37 tiger on the hilltop south-west of the camp, for now: he is two over you here, and the 40-50 Stranglethorn guide comes back to him.
  tip Careful: The raptor nest has young raptors that join the fight when you attack the adults.
  collect 3918 quest 605
  collect 1519 quest 189
  kill 685 quest 194

step Zimmix Sputterspark
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip Zimmix Sputterspark is held at the east edge of the Ruins of Zul'Kunda; the Stolen Shipments lie among the ruins around him. The Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics (34-35) there carry his Primitive Key. Then lead him out of the ruins: Wharfmaster Lozgil in Booty Bay takes the news and the shipments.
  tip Careful: Bloodscalp Berserkers and Headhunters (36-37) and Witch Doctors (37, casters) hold the ruins north and west of Zimmix, close to the northern shipments (around 24.9,9.6): pick the shipments in the southern ruins by Zimmix first, and pull one at a time if you go north.
  accept 97329 @23.46,12.79           -- Zimmix Sputterspark
  collect 277953 quest 97328.1 @24.25,12.24 -- Stolen Shipments, in the ruins
  collect 277957 quest 97329.1        -- Primitive Key, from the Bloodscalp Scouts, Hunters and Mystics
  turnin 97329
  accept 97331
  complete 97331 @26.8,11.4
  note Escort Zimmix out of the ruins and keep him alive: Lozgil takes the news once he is safe.

