step Lashtail Raptors
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip On your way back south to Grom'gol, the Lashtail Raptors (35-36) hunt the jungle between the camp and Grom'gol: they count for Hemet and for Commander Aggro'gosh. Careful: the 36s can be two over you: pull them one at a time. Carnivorous Weeds (36-38) are rooted in the jungle south of the raptors: walk around them.
  kill 686 quest 195 @32.4,23.2 map 1434
  kill 686 quest 568

