step Stranglethorn Vale: kill these as you meet them
  zone Stranglethorn Vale
  tip East of the Mosh'Ogg hills, Shadowmaw Panthers (37-38) stalk the jungle towards the lake; the Stranglethorn Tigresses roam the same ground and now and then drop a pristine fang. Snapjaw Crocolisks line the river just west of the jungle; keep their skins for Drizzlik. Careful: Shadowmaw Panthers (level 37-38) and Elder Shadowmaw Panthers (level 42-43) use Sneak while out of combat, so they remain hidden until you get near them; the 38s can be two over you: pull them one at a time and leave the Elders alone.
  collect 3838 quest 570.1
  collect 3839 quest 570.2
  kill 684 quest 192 @41.3,34.8 map 1434
  collect 4104 quest 577 @39.9,28.4

step Mosh'Ogg camp
  tip The Mosh'Ogg ogres camp in the hills just east of Grom'gol, on your way back. Kill 10 Brutes and 5 Witch Doctors (36-37); pull them one at a time. Careful: the 37s can be two over you: take them from the camp's western edge, never two together.
  kill 1142 quest 569.1
  kill 1144 quest 569.2

